{s:OUT,k:'outro',term:'Outro',say:'So remember: the best load matches the Thevenin resistance, at only fifty percent efficiency. Source and ammeter swap freely in a bilateral network. And minus for every source facing B. Next time, the compensation theorem. See you there!',cues:{f:'So remember',w1:'the best load',w2:'Source and ammeter',w3:'And minus for',n:'Next time',s:'See you there'},words:[['BEST LOAD = Rth','BLU','w1'],['SWAP: SAME READING','ORG','w2'],['+ AT B: ENTER −Vk','GRN','w3']],next:["NEXT TIME", "Next lesson", "Compensation theorem", "book"],end:'See you there!'}
